WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.000
[ Music ]

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.580
[Narrator:] Buried here is a man who died before his time,

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:33.062
his grave a monument to ignorance and fraud.

00:00:33.063 --> 00:00:36.396
There was little to be done about John Martin's stupidity,

00:00:36.396 --> 00:00:42.629
but ultimately there was an answer to another man's deceit.

00:00:42.629 --> 00:00:46.262
John Martin, who clipped an ad and sent away for a bottle of medicine,

00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:48.463
died of a common disease.

00:00:48.463 --> 00:00:54.200
And yet you might also say he was murdered. Murdered as surely as though the deed had been done by bullet or knife.

00:00:58.329 --> 00:01:02.762
But, John Martin, deceased, was not the only one who had seen that ad.

00:01:02.763 --> 00:01:07.563
It also came to the attention of some interested people in Food and Drug Administration,

00:01:07.563 --> 00:01:10.296
operating under the Federal Security Agency.

00:01:10.296 --> 00:01:13.962
Its aims: to combat filth and fraud in our food products

00:01:13.963 --> 00:01:18.463
and to guarantee, as best it can, that medicines and cosmetics not only contain

00:01:18.463 --> 00:01:22.900
what the makers say they contain, but do what the makers claim they'll do.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:32.720
[ Music ]

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:38.040
And so, to a bureau official comes an ad clipped from a newspaper.

00:01:38.796 --> 00:01:43.662
Relief at last, a remedy for diabetes, arthritis, kidney disorders,

00:01:43.662 --> 00:01:51.060
and well, it was a suspiciously long list of guarantees, and a matter for the nearest regional office to check into.

00:01:52.829 --> 00:01:56.360
A network of 16 district stations covers the country,

00:01:56.363 --> 00:02:01.263
and from the New York office inspector Kennedy, starting out with only a small advertisement,

00:02:01.263 --> 00:02:09.120
launches the chain of events which will determine how much validity, if any, there is in the claims of a preparation called Elixirex.

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:30.160
[ Music ]

00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:34.363
In a small industrial city, Inspector Kennedy locates the manufacturer

00:02:34.363 --> 00:02:36.996
but his wife says he is out of town.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.080
Be gone two weeks, perhaps, maybe a month.

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:46.400
[ Music ] [Chatting]

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:49.140
Sure, she'll show him where the Elixirex is made.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.420
It's right back in the garage.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:58.560
The Food and Drug Administration, FDA, is constantly ferreting out products.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.820
manufactured under filthy and unsanitary conditions.

00:03:02.429 --> 00:03:06.220
But at the moment, this is not Kennedy's primary objective.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:09.380
He subsequently asks the woman for a list of her husband's customers,

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:14.460
but she insists that she knows nothing about any such list. Wouldn't even know where to look for one.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:30.500
[ Music ] [Chatting]

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:34.120
But Inspector Kennedy doesn't wait for his man to return.

00:03:34.129 --> 00:03:37.995
Like skinning a cat, there is more than one way to run down evidence,

00:03:37.996 --> 00:03:41.262
so Kennedy sets out on some tedious legwork.

00:03:41.263 --> 00:03:48.163
Starting with a local trucking company, he tries to uncover shipping orders to distributors, or even individual orders,

00:03:48.163 --> 00:03:53.340
which, to avoid possible involvement, often are sent a bottle or two at a time by express.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.700
[ Music ]

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:02.696
After going through mountains of records his patience is finally rewarded.

00:04:02.696 --> 00:04:06.929
He finds half a dozen orders, three of which are in his own district.

00:04:06.929 --> 00:04:17.163
[ Music ]

00:04:17.163 --> 00:04:20.360
Now, begins the second phase of Inspector Kennedy's task:

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:25.780
the gathering of evidence that will stand up in court if necessary, proof that Elixirex

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.060
was bought and used.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.660
Yes, she has used it regularly, this lady told him in another town.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.040
Best thing she'd found, yet, for her arthritis.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:38.160
Matter-of-fact, she just finished a bottle and has to send away for another.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:56.320
[ Music ]

00:04:56.329 --> 00:04:59.529
Two days later, Kennedy makes a real strike.

00:04:59.529 --> 00:05:02.062
Her husband had been using Elixirex regularly,

00:05:02.062 --> 00:05:03.900
said Mrs. John Martin.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.320
But Mr. Martin had died three weeks ago.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.740
He'd been taking Elixirex for diabetes,

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:15.120
had given up his insulin injections for this simplified sure shot cure-all.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.480
Hadn't consulted his doctor, of course.

00:05:20.629 --> 00:05:23.260
Kennedy, sealing the remnants as evidence,

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:27.120
assigns a sample number and identifies the seal with his initials.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.429
But the word of the wife of the deceased is not enough.

00:05:33.429 --> 00:05:37.900
The chain of evidence must then be linked to include a photostatic copy of the death certificate.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:39.740
The official cause of death, diabetes.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:47.820
[ Music ]

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.900
And now, the Food and Drug people want to know...what is Elixirex?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:06:00.080
What's in it? In every district station is a battery of crack chemists and microanalysts who fight the battle against filth and fraud.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.000
To one of these comes Elixirex.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:07.240
[Music]

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:11.620
The magic formula to relieve sickness and pain turns out to be nothing more

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:19.100
than a mixture of water and an alcoholic extract of certain herbaceous weeds that grow in profusion in the maker's back yard.

00:06:19.862 --> 00:06:24.820
It is instantly clear to the district chief that Elixiex is a flagrant violation of the law.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.180
But it must be decided officially.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:33.900
Before he can issue a citation against the manufacturer, the evidence must be weighed by medical officers in Washington.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:38.880
Here, food and drug physicians consider the matter from a purely medical view.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:43.900
What, according to a consensus of the group, will this mixture do for any of the following;

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:48.380
diabetes, arthritis, or any of the aches and pains it guarantees to cure?

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:51.600
The answer is a flat, unequivocable, nothing.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:07:00.060
The law moves swiftly. The maker has a chance to show cause why he should not be prosecuted,

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:02.700
but there is little he can do to refute the evidence.

00:07:03.063 --> 00:07:05.920
The maker receives a year in jail and a stiff fine.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:11.120
Too late to help John Martin, but not too late to protect the lives and health of others.

00:07:13.129 --> 00:07:18.480
And so, another result of bureau vigilance rests among the Rogue's Gallery of typical frauds

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.940
brought to book.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.760
To look at this display, you would think the nation is susceptible to anything.

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:28.360
Unfortunately, there is opportunity to prey on the ignorant and unsuspecting.

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:32.180
People who cannot afford or who spurn a doctor's advice

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:39.200
are easy marks for extravagant claims or weird devices that have as much effect as a spell cast by a witch doctor.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:46.520
The inventor of this electrical gimmick claimed great healing qualities for colored lights.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:50.560
Just bask in the glow your misery calls for and you're as good as new.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.640
It's almost unbelievable that he sold thousands of these.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.929
A cheese distributor did a brisk business in imported Swiss,

00:07:57.929 --> 00:08:03.620
or at least the label said it was imported. He wound up getting a longer trip than the cheese took.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:16.140
Now, curbing violations takes a lot of coordination of department forces. The planning division in Washington plots investigations on a geographical and time basis,

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:20.420
so that representative plants are checked regularly in every area.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:24.620
Even, such things as economic trends play a part.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.880
A crop failure due to weather, for example,

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:32.120
puts the agency on the alert against inferior products going into canned or bottled goods.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:37.680
[ Music ]

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:43.020
Inspectors are authorized to enter, without advance notice, a food or drug plant doing interstate business.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:48.300
Virtually all have college degrees in a science such as chemistry, bacteriology, or biology.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:54.460
At fishing ports, a distributor never knows when his frozen fillet line will be tested.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:59.920
A single whiff will tell the trained inspector if this is one that should have got away.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:07.720
Nothing takes precedence over FDA deciding what shall enter the country from abroad.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:12.980
A sample of every shipment is examined. Here, olives are being selected at random.

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:19.196
[ Music ]

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.620
If there's anything foreign besides the rum in these bottles,

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:25.360
this candling process will reveal it.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:34.640
Expert tea testers, who have devoted a lifetime to their work, set minimum standards for all brands.

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:39.360
In Washington, meanwhile, is a tremendous laboratory,

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:44.600
which not only backs up the core of inspectors but constantly pursues projects of its own.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:50.780
Here, in the division of microbiology are samples of virtually every growing thing known to man,

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:57.900
through which analysts can determine, to almost fantastic lengths, what foreign elements may be in a suspected product.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:04.760
[ Music ]

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:09.900
Literally anything can be detected, from a microscopic fragment of a fly's wing,

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:13.180
down to a wispy minuscule of a dandelion puff.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:20.540
Here too, they decide on standards for such things as surgical sutures and adhesive tape.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.940
How sticky should sticky be?

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:31.980
Now, one of the marks of our so-called enlightened civilization has been the development and interest in vitamin products.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:35.600
But big-time promotion has resulted in possible abuses,

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.440
which the vitamin division seeks to control.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:44.900
It is important, therefore, to determine whether a product is what it alleges to be and will do the job it claims.

00:10:44.980 --> 00:11:03.720
[ Music ]

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:08.060
Constant experiments are made, not only to certified commercial products,

00:11:08.062 --> 00:11:11.140
but to probe theories of the department scientists.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:14.260
Here is a test made on white mice from the same litter.

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:17.600
Those which have been getting a certain vitamin grow large and strong.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.420
Those deprived of it are weak and puny.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:29.760
[ Music ]

00:11:29.763 --> 00:11:36.329
Consider now, the lifesaving drugs that deserve the label of wonder or miracle products.

00:11:36.329 --> 00:11:38.929
Penicillin and the newer streptomycin.

00:11:38.929 --> 00:11:43.962
These must never be allowed to waver from the knife-edged path of purity and potency.

00:11:43.962 --> 00:11:51.640
Every pharmaceutical house that manufactures them must submit for analysis a sample of each batch made before they can be distributed.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:12:00.520
[ Music ]

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:04.840
And it is almost a full-time concern of the Division of Food Control.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:11.200
To what lengths? Well, there's a man who's interested in how tender a top-grade garden pea should be.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:15.160
If his teeth won't tell him for sure, he's got a gadget that will.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:19.520
If it's too hard, it isn't top grade and may not be sold as such.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:30.640
[ Music ]

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.880
Because the war greatly advanced synthetic chemistry,

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:38.140
new compounds for crop or soil improvement are in wide use.

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.980
Department experts want to know if flavor and nutritional safety are affected.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:51.160
With American women spending millions of dollars yearly on cosmetics,

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:56.360
FDA is intent on preventing the price of beauty from becoming tragically high.

00:12:56.829 --> 00:13:01.520
The files in Washington offer new testimony and painful proof that despite

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:08.080
their lovely packaging and glowing claims, some of the bland and innocent-looking pastes and powders

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.760
not only are worthless, but health hazards.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:14.740
There is no attempt to disclaim that a product will improve upon nature.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:20.340
It is just that every beauty preparation in the interstate market must pass a rigid safety test.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:31.680
[ Music ]

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:36.720
As long as their country cousins don't see them, these bunnies have nothing to worry about.

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:42.460
Seems someone has an idea for a hair curling preparation and FDA wants to study it.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:52.096
[ Music ]

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.940
Of great importance is the work done by the Color Certification Division.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:14:03.040
A large percentage of our food, drugs, and cosmetics are colored by dyes and it is vital to know their derivations.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:09.400
Coal tar dyes and certain mixtures can be extremely dangerous if not pure or used properly.

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:14.460
Every manufacturer must submit samples for certifications before using them.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:22.780
Here then, is where the real ingredients of satisfaction are determined.

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:31.020
Where men of science provide fact or fallacy for claims and labels that read ''Best by Test'' or ''Finest Available''.

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:35.880
Not a day goes by when we do not profit by their zeal and watchfulness,

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.780
our standard of living, waving higher and higher.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:43.640
For certainly, it can be said that nowhere in the world can people buy with more confidence,

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:49.180
or use with greater safety, the thousand and one products which go into their daily lives.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:57.460
[ Music ]

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:02.780
[ Music ]  [Chatting]

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:09.960
[ Music ]

00:15:09.963 --> 00:15:12.996
So, let these tireless feet be a symbol.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.860
A symbol of a nation's concern for its consumers.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:21.120
An assurance that all its ramparts of safety are ably defended.

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:23.960
For this, too, is part of our heritage.

00:15:23.963 --> 00:15:26.929
This, too, is a battle that must be waged and won.

00:15:26.929 --> 00:15:30.695
A battle against deceit and fraud and, sometimes, nature.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:33.960
This Is vigilance at its attentive best,

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:37.160
safeguarding the health and welfare of a nation.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:48.120
[ Music ]

